{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "偿付不变量",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 124.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "借贷协议靠一条不变量运转：每个账户的抵押品，打折以后，要盖得住借款。",
   "spoken": "借贷协议靠一条不变量运转：每个账户的抵押品，打折以后，要盖得住借款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 9.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "打折的比例，叫清算阈值。",
   "spoken": "打折的比例，叫清算阈值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 9.88,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 9.972,
   "speechEnd": 12.326
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "抵押品价值乘以清算阈值，再除以借款，就是健康因子。",
   "spoken": "抵押品价值乘以清算阈值，再除以借款，就是健康因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.74,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 12.836,
   "speechEnd": 17.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "健康因子大于 1，账户安全。小于 1，任何人都可以清算它。",
   "spoken": "健康因子大于 1，账户安全。小于 1，任何人都可以清算它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 18.32,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 18.414,
   "speechEnd": 23.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "清算，是第三方替账户偿还债务，再以折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "spoken": "清算，是第三方替账户偿还债务，再以折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 23.58,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 23.674,
   "speechEnd": 29.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "折扣，是给清算人的报酬。",
   "spoken": "折扣，是给清算人的报酬。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 29.4,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 29.499,
   "speechEnd": 31.621
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "回到 Euler。按 Omniscia 和 BlockSec 的复盘，捐赠以后，账户已经资不抵债。",
   "spoken": "回到 Euler。按 Omniscia 和 BlockSec 的复盘，捐赠以后，账户已经资不抵债。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 32.02,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 32.118,
   "speechEnd": 38.719
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "而 Euler 的清算折扣，会随资不抵债的程度变大。",
   "spoken": "而 Euler 的清算折扣，会随资不抵债的程度变大。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 39.12,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 39.12,
   "speechEnd": 43.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "攻击者用另一个账户来清算它，以很大的折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "spoken": "攻击者用另一个账户来清算它，以很大的折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 43.74,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 43.831,
   "speechEnd": 48.238
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "缺口越大，折扣越大。坏账，变成了利润。",
   "spoken": "缺口越大，折扣越大。坏账，变成了利润。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 48.68,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 48.68,
   "speechEnd": 52.326
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "整个协议也有一条不变量：所有资产，要盖得住所有存款人的债权。",
   "spoken": "整个协议也有一条不变量：所有资产，要盖得住所有存款人的债权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 52.74,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 52.838,
   "speechEnd": 58.076
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "盖不住的部分，就是坏账。",
   "spoken": "盖不住的部分，就是坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 58.48,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 58.48,
   "speechEnd": 60.293
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "坏账不一定来自攻击。",
   "spoken": "坏账不一定来自攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 60.7,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 60.7,
   "speechEnd": 62.498
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "价格暴跌，预言机延迟，清算来不及，都会留下坏账。",
   "spoken": "价格暴跌，预言机延迟，清算来不及，都会留下坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 62.92,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 63.01,
   "speechEnd": 67.451
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "清算人是逐利的。奖励覆盖不了 gas 和滑点，就没人清算。",
   "spoken": "清算人是逐利的。奖励覆盖不了 gas 和滑点，就没人清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 67.86,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 67.86,
   "speechEnd": 73.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "抵押品流动性不足，清算人拿到手，也卖不出好价钱。",
   "spoken": "抵押品流动性不足，清算人拿到手，也卖不出好价钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 73.44,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 73.534,
   "speechEnd": 77.855
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "再看一个例子。2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 Venus，允许用户拿自己的治理代币 XVS 做抵押。",
   "spoken": "再看一个例子。2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 Venus，允许用户拿自己的治理代币 XVS 做抵押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 78.3,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 78.403,
   "speechEnd": 86.959
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，XVS 短时间里，从约 76 美元涨到约 144 美元。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，XVS 短时间里，从约 76 美元涨到约 144 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 87.4,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 87.5,
   "speechEnd": 94.071
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "抵押能力跟着上涨，有人借走了大量 BTC 和 ETH。",
   "spoken": "抵押能力跟着上涨，有人借走了大量 BTC 和 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 94.5,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 94.594,
   "speechEnd": 99.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "XVS 回落以后，清算金额约 2 亿美元以上，仍然留下约 9500 万美元以上的坏账。",
   "spoken": "XVS 回落以后，清算金额约 2 亿美元以上，仍然留下约 9500 万美元以上的坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 99.6,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 99.699,
   "speechEnd": 107.216
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "项目方称，价格可能被操纵。",
   "spoken": "项目方称，价格可能被操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 107.66,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 107.66,
   "speechEnd": 109.923
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "这叫反身性。价格上涨，借款增加，卖压增加，价格下跌，坏账出现。",
   "spoken": "这叫反身性。价格上涨，借款增加，卖压增加，价格下跌，坏账出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 110.36,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 110.36,
   "speechEnd": 117.385
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "所以，低流动性的抵押品，要有供应上限和更低的抵押率。",
   "spoken": "所以，低流动性的抵押品，要有供应上限和更低的抵押率。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 117.86,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 117.951,
   "speechEnd": 123.051
  }
 ],
